żąca klatka wideo zastąpi obraz okładki tej sceny. Nie można tego cofnąć z poziomu aplikacji."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Het huidige videoframe vervangt de omslagafbeelding van deze scène. Dit kan niet in de app ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Geçerli video karesi bu sahnenin kapak resminin yerini alacak. Bu işlem uygulamadan geri alınamaz."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"目前的影片畫面將取代此短片的封面圖片。此動作無法從 App 中還原。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"当前视频帧将替换此短片的封面图片。此操作无法在 App 中撤销。"}}}},"hint_custom_app_icons_are_part":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Özel uygulama simgeleri stashy+'nın parçasıdır. Ayarlar'da kilidini aç"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Anpassade appsymboler ingår i stashy+. Lås upp i Inställningar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"自訂 App 圖像是 stashy+ 的一部分。請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"自定 App 图标属于 stashy+。请在设置中解锁"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brugerdefinerede appikoner er en del af stashy+. Lås op i Indstillinger"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Собственные значки приложения входят в stashy+. Разблокируйте в настройках"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ícones de app personalizados fazem parte do stashy+. Desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los iconos de app personalizados forman parte de stashy+. Desbloquéalos en Ajustes"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Eigene App-Icons sind Teil von stashy+. In den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Custom app icons are part of stashy+. Unlock in Settings"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"사용자 지정 앱 아이콘은 stashy+의 일부입니다. 설정에서 잠금 해제하세요"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review"