аются на этом устройстве."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Servidores, chaves de API e ajustes ficam neste dispositivo de qualquer forma."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Serwery, klucze API i ustawienia i tak pozostają na tym urządzeniu."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les serveurs, clés API et réglages restent sur cet appareil dans tous les cas."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Server, chiavi API e impostazioni restano comunque su questo dispositivo."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los servidores, las claves de API y los ajustes se quedan en este dispositivo en cualquier caso."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無論如何，伺服器、API 金鑰和設定都會保留在此裝置上。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无论如何，服务器、API 密钥和设置都会保留在此设备上。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Servrar, API-nycklar och inställningar stannar på den här enheten i båda fallen."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucular, API anahtarları ve ayarlar her durumda bu aygıtta kalır."}}}},"hint_servers_settings_default_filters_dashboard":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"将服务器、设置、默认过滤器、Dashboard 和标签页存为一个 JSON 文件 — 可在 iPhone、iPad、Mac 和 Android 上导入。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Servrar, inställningar, standardfilter, Dashboard och flikar som en JSON-fil – kan importeras på iPhone, iPad, Mac och Android."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"伺服器、設定、預設篩選條件、Dashboard 和標籤頁會匯出為一個 JSON 檔案 — 可在 iPhone、iPad、Mac 和 Android 上匯入。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucular, ayarlar, varsayılan filtreler, Dashboard ve sekmeler tek bir JSON dosyası olarak — iPhone, iPad, Mac ve Android'de içe aktarılabilir."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Servidores, ajustes, filtros predeterminados, Dashboard y pestañas en un solo 