ene wird von Apples SpeechTranscriber nicht unterstützt (z. B. steht Tschechisch nicht auf der Liste)."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O idioma desta cena não é compatível com o SpeechTranscriber da Apple (ex.: tcheco não está na lista)."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このシーンの言語はAppleのSpeechTranscriberでサポートされていません（例：チェコ語はリストにありません）。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dette scenesprog understøttes ikke af Apples SpeechTranscriber (f.eks. er tjekkisk ikke på listen)."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"This scene language is not supported by Apple’s SpeechTranscriber (e.g. Czech is not on the list)."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dette scenespråket støttes ikke av Apples SpeechTranscriber (f.eks. er ikke tsjekkisk på listen)."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El SpeechTranscriber de Apple no admite el idioma de esta escena (p. ej., el checo no está en la lista)."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ten język sceny nie jest obsługiwany przez SpeechTranscriber firmy Apple (np. czeskiego nie ma na liście)."}}}},"hint_this_server_has_no_studios":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo server non ha ancora studi."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Denne server har ingen studier endnu."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 서버에는 아직 스튜디오가 없습니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este servidor aún no tiene estudios."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"This server has no studios yet."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ce serveur n’a pas encore de studios."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Denne serveren har ingen studioer ennå."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieser Server hat noch keine Studios."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze